ounting-master/runs/20261002T181809-4cb566e0/P03/plan-0.response.json:7:    \"3. Define immutable typed Program, declaration and expression constructors, CompileBindings, CompileResult and Diagnostic interfaces. CompileBindings must explicitly supply package locks, evidence/view records, accepted synthetic readings, symbol admissions, opening balances, context metadata and assumption/alternative metadata absent from surface syntax. Separate package definitions from caller-supplied evidence. Resolve only local, declared, kind-checked, digest-locked exports; reject missing bindings, wrong versions, collisions, escaping paths and unsupported exports. Never infer acceptance from a source declaration or manufacture reviewer identities, timestamps, probabilities or missing context.\",\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T181809-4cb566e0/P03/plan-0.response.json:27:    \"Lexical/binding rejection: malformed syntax, reserved names, invalid dates/escapes, duplicate declarations/fields, unknown references, cyclic lets, unresolved or ambiguous exports and missing external metadata. Specifically distinguish bare 0.05 from 0.05 per year.\",\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T181809-4cb566e0/P03/plan-0.response.json:46:    \"data/financial-report-benchmark/release-manifest.json\",\ndata/accounting-master/runs/preflight-20261002/P00/corpus-integrity.json:4625:          \"quote\": \"ion of the Company’s management, the condensed consolidated financial statements reflect all adjustments, which are normal and recurring in nature, necessary for fair financial statement presentation. The preparation of these condensed consolidated financial statements in conformity with U.S. generally accepted accounting principles (“GAAP”) requires management to make estimates and assumptions that affect the amounts reported in these condensed consolidated financial statements and accompanying notes. Actual\",\ndata/accounting-master/runs/preflight-20261002/P00/corpus-integrity.json:4637:         